OL,3,GNEWSARare snow leopard cub with
OL,4,Aincurable bone condition put to sleep
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of two rare snow leopard cubs born
OL,7,Fat the Highland Wildlife Park earlier
OL,8,Fthis year has been euthanised after it
OL,9,Fwas found to have an incurable bone
OL,10,Fcondition.
OL,12,FThe twins were born in June to
OL,13,Ffirst-time mum Pari and her mate Koshi,
OL,14,Fand were the first litter at the Royal
OL,15,FZoological Society of Scotland (RZSS)
OL,16,Fsite at Kincraig in four years.
OL,18,FKeepers had spotted the male cub,
OL,19,FIndra, was limping and extensive
OL,20,Fmedical examinations detected the
OL,21,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
